       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the maximum labeled ibuprofen dose.\n\n- **Per dose:** The usual maximum is 800 mg. 1600 mg is double that.\n- **Per day:** The maximum for prescription use is 3,200 mg/day. This order is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Risks at that level:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Having normal kidney and liver function and no allergies doesn't make this dose safe.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth, 3 times daily**, which is a more typical dose for inflammatory pain\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into smaller doses\n\nIf 1600 mg four times daily is what you intend, tell me the clinical rationale and I'll enter it with a note. Otherwise, give me the corrected dose and I'll enter it right away."
